<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta
    name="viewport"
    content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"
  >

  <meta
    name="robots"
    content="noindex"
  >

  <title>Halaman Tidak Ditemukan — PUSAT WIFI</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: dark;
      font-family:
        Inter,
        ui-sans-serif,
        system-ui,
        -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "Segoe UI",
        sans-serif;
      background: #07111f;
      color: #f4f8ff;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 50% 20%,
          rgba(53,167,255,.12),
          transparent 32rem
        ),
        #07111f;
    }

    main {
      width: min(100%, 560px);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .code {
      margin: 0;
      color: #35a7ff;
      font-size: 90px;
      line-height: .9;
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: -.08em;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 20px 0 10px;
      font-size: 32px;
      letter-spacing: -.04em;
    }

    p {
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
      color: #8fa0b6;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    a {
      display: inline-flex;
      min-height: 48px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0 18px;
      border-radius: 11px;
      background: #1688e8;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 800;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <main>

    <p class="code">404</p>

    <h1>Halaman tidak ditemukan.</h1>

    <p>
      Sepertinya halaman yang Anda cari sudah dipindahkan
      atau alamatnya tidak tersedia.
    </p>

    <a href="/">
      Kembali ke PUSAT WIFI
    </a>

  </main>

</body>
</html>